{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_06_beg","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_06","title":"海鮮拼盤","storyCode":"DT-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"174c2941178f1b65bfcc7b5774583892e0ab22bc4a4615b5403e513e28d0b6bb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"鹽風城居民的慘狀讓先西萌生了為他們做一頓豐盛的料理的想法。但此地深海教會的教士不這麼想，他看向遠處盤踞著海嗣的溶洞，做了一個決定。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"narration","text":"獵人墜落的樣子彷彿——\n——流星。\n身在深海中的人甚少看見這種奇景。\n那沉迷慾望和陰謀、從不抬頭仰望的主教，更不可能知曉這等景色。\n但他們不一樣。\n當深海獵人們拼命向上游去，想從陰鬱與犧牲中掙脫時，當他們躋身海面，靜靜欣賞無邊星空時……\n獵人們都在心中記錄了這些短命星辰的命運。\n即使如此，也會劃破黑暗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，死吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三顆流星照亮了幽邃的通道。\n主教恐懼萬分，他沒有肺，沒有聲道，這鳴響只是他的新身體用以替代慘叫的新方式。\n殘垣斷壁裡，怪物將死的臃腫肉體填塞了大半個溶洞。牠原本不斷散發出奇異之美的古怪軀體因牠對死亡的畏懼而越顯僵硬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教死去了。他的一切都將被遺忘。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_RL2_cliffday"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況不太妙啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個城市周圍沒有絲毫活物的氣息……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來在這裡很難蒐集到像樣的補給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，有什麼發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒什麼變化，這座城裡其他地方也都是一句話都不會說的傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們看到食物倒是會有反應，但還是不會回答我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於補給，別說讓他們分我們一些了，我甚至把身上僅剩的口糧分了一點給他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是，這座城市的大部分民居只能用淒涼來形容……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真難以想像，這裡的人能在這種環境下生存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫找遍了好幾個市場，看起來都很久沒營業了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說這裡的大部分人已經很久沒有好好吃過東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫看在眼裡實在是心痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟著一個人一路來到海邊，本來以為能發現什麼，結果——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"喝……喝……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他就這樣和其他人一樣，漫無目的地在海邊遊蕩，有的時候挖一挖沙，好像沙灘上會有吃的長出來一樣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_189","isRemote":false,"text":"餓……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鱗、殼，可以吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"吃吧，吃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"先西放下了手中的斧，快步走到兩人的面前，伸手打開了他們的包裹。\n裡面堆放著剛從沙灘上撿拾來的鱗和殼，而且都已經輕微腐爛，發出難以忍受的腥臭味。\n可兩人渾然不覺，生怕先西搶他們的，馬上就往嘴裡塞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這實在是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也太淒慘了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然這裡沒什麼能幫我們的東西，我們還是儘快離開這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的民風民俗實在是太奇怪了，人們感覺也不太友善的樣子……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是老夫的猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的人很可能是長時間沒有吃過正常的食物，導致他們對周圍的一切都逐漸麻木。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這時候讓他們吃到一頓美食，或許可以讓他們恢復一點知覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你不清楚也不奇怪，長時間的食物匱乏，還有生活環境的壓縮，是會讓人一點一點麻木的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽起來很有經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，老夫也希望讓這裡的人吃上一頓飽飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不管怎麼說，我們也要為自己找食物，不然的話，我們也走不了多遠，對吧，奇爾查克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唉，說得也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，事先說好，補給不見了是你們在薩米亂跑搞出來的事情，所以別指望靠我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遊蕩的旅行者，你們是否在尋找食物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，你聽得懂我們的話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！我們——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，瑪露希爾，其他人都聽不懂我們說話，他卻聽得懂，你不覺得奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們會有所警惕也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，不用擔心，我是為了提供指引給你們而來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是一名教士，四處行走，為人們帶去大海的教誨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們呢？你們不像是伊比利亞人，為什麼會來到這座鹽風城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們正在籌集旅行的補給。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來進展不太順利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，沒有關係，既然我們來了，就不會讓你們挨餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……“我們”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我們是庇護這座城市的教會，在教會之中，人人都是兄弟手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"縱使你們是外來者，若願意聽從指引，便是我們的手足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們肯定不會眼看手足受餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽起來有點詭異……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們能跟著他找到食物，城裡那些人也能吃到一頓正常的飯吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別自顧自地說出好像要入教一樣的話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，大海的恩澤無窮無盡，不會吝惜與你們分享萬億分之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但，只有足夠強大的人才能獲得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我猜他的意思是，他知道哪裡有食物，但是人們不一定有命去拿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以這樣理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不勉強你們涉險，只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我們吧，我們都是有經驗的冒險者，一些危險我們還是能夠處理的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沿著海岸線往南走，那裡有一座洞窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洞窟裡，有你們想要的東西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，那個人有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還聽他說的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的氛圍這麼奇怪，總覺得和那個人說的教會多少有點關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著他所謂的“指引”，總能發現點什麼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果有埋伏的話，奇爾查克一定能提前察覺到的吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，也是啦……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？這是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克拉肯！好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，牠已經不會動彈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！已經死掉了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！這麼巨大的克拉肯……那個教士果然沒有騙我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看這腕足，看這吸盤，看這海葵一樣的器官——這應該是牠的……頭部？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真想看看牠還活著的時候的樣子，應該跟一座塔的大小差不多，一定超級威風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……但是克拉肯很難吃呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是克拉肯，但似乎也是有著共同淵源的種族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的胃開始痛了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種來路不明的東西，絕對不能吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也同意，不能吃牠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克&瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海裡的生物在死後身體內可能會分泌毒素。比如螃蟹，即使死了沒有多久，也可能被病菌污染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真的想吃的話……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西&萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以看看裡面還有沒有活著的寄生蟲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊我真的是多嘴——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都說了這種時候最好別說話啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這麼龐大的生物究竟是被誰殺死的呢？想要躲開這些腕足的攻擊應該不太容易……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，萊歐斯，我聽到了什麼聲音……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪露希爾用棍子挑起一長串黏黏的、散發著螢光的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……看起來有點噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在白天也閃爍著螢光，好美麗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行啦，我要丟掉它了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真浪費……咦，丟到什麼東西上了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊歐斯，注意腳下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！這是海草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心，萊歐斯，踩在這些海草上的感覺不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這麼一說……身體的確有點麻耶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都小心一點，不要踩在這些海草上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是按你這麼說，我們能站的地方可就不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來這個洞穴裡面的這些植物，也全都是魔物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毫無疑問，我們正身處這個巨大克拉肯魔物的巢穴之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而正從洞穴裡湧出來的這些，都是生活在牠身邊的伴生生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是新鮮食材！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾，你能對著這些海草使用你的魔法嗎？放個火什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了？在這裡放火，不就等於告訴洞裡的那些怪物，我們來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我就是這個意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海草是從洞窟深處蔓延過來的，追著怪物進入深處的話，只會對我們更加不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不如用一把火告訴牠們，我們來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……聽起來真的像是經過了深思熟慮之後得出的結論呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我們不會硬來的，你就留在外面，只要打到了足夠多的食材，我們就原路撤回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的出了什麼事，你也可以接應我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嘖，隨你的便。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然還只是個孩子啊，奇爾查克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……話說回來，你就這麼理所當然地覺得我會聽你的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瑪露希爾看到萊歐斯的表情就知道，他的確是沒想過別的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧，摀住耳朵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
